    "description": {
      "value": "<p>At 6th level, and every six levels thereafter, a magical girl gains a bonus feat in addition to those gained from normal advancement. These bonus feats must be selected from those listed as combat or metamagic feats. She must meet the prerequisites for these feats as normal.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/magical-girl#toc9\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
